flowchart TD
    Start([开始]):::startEnd --> InputUser[/输入用户名/]:::io
    InputUser --> CheckUser{用户名是否有效?}:::decision

    CheckUser -->|是| InputPass[/输入密码/]:::io
    CheckUser -->|否| InputUser

    InputPass --> CheckPass{密码是否正确?}:::decision

    CheckPass -->|是| Success[登录成功]:::success
    CheckPass -->|否| Error[显示错误]:::error

    Error --> InputPass

    Success --> Home[进入主页]:::process
    Home --> End([结束]):::startEnd

    classDef startEnd fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px,color:#1b5e20
    classDef process fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px,color:#0d47a1
    classDef decision fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#f9a825,stroke-width:2px,color:#f57f17
    classDef io fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px,color:#b71c1c
    classDef success fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,stroke-width:2px,color:#1b5e20
    classDef error fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#d32f2f,stroke-width:2px,color:#c62828
